{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:29f01e9187517568","name":"Sando's Boys","source":{"id":"source:reference-29f01e9187517568","title":"Sando's Boys","revision":23566,"timestamp":"2024-09-29T23:32:41Z","sha256":"95f04ef0e0a30fdeec615d9287255bf5bb193d86a6ea37fa2f304d51506e5360","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23566","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sando%27s%20Boys&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-29f01e9187517568","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rodian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rodian","referenceId":"reference:26980c5af3a71c5b"}," criminal, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sando"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sando","referenceId":"reference:b1f1e175e939d6dd"},", leads a band of pirates and thugs that ply their trade near the fringes of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"},". Lately, Sando's Boys has been looting the old smuggler bases in the caverns of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Volik"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Volik","referenceId":"reference:24aae6e1e2447b18"},", which is more profitable than making raids on ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},". When smuggler groups come to blows, they tend to wipe each other out, leaving stashes of ill-gotten gains on the planet. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sando"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sando","referenceId":"reference:b1f1e175e939d6dd"}," has a herd of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reykos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reykos"}," that can haul out the bigger prizes, such as abandoned ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},". She knows that many of the smugglers made their bases in the canyons, so she has created a detailed map of the area. Her map is not perfect, since cave-ins and other natural phenomena occur, but it is the most up-to-date.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In a recent cavern expedition, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sando"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sando","referenceId":"reference:b1f1e175e939d6dd"}," discovered the cargo manifest of an old freighter that mentioned ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mask of Darth Nihilus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mask_of_Darth_Nihilus_(Sith_Artifact)","referenceId":"reference:03b282a19442577f"},", stating that it was transferred to the captain's secret stash for safekeeping. She thinks that if she can find the mask, she can make a big score by putting it on the market for bidding. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sando"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sando","referenceId":"reference:b1f1e175e939d6dd"}," is aware of the legend of the mask, but she thinks it is just a story. She does not believe in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," or other such nonsense.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Sando's Boys Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Heroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sando"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sando","referenceId":"reference:b1f1e175e939d6dd"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 13\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
